# 统一文本换行：仓库内存 LF，检出时不因平台产生 CRLF 噪声（X-04）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 脚本保留可执行位语义（如后续加 .sh）
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
